OL,3,GNEWSAWhat Poundland's collapse says
OL,4,Aabout Britain's high streets
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt Poundland in Hanley, shoppers are
OL,7,Fstill coming and going.
OL,9,FJoe says the staff are a big part of
OL,10,Fwhat makes the store important to him.
OL,12,F"The people are great. The staff are
OL,13,Fgreat," he said.
OL,15,FBut he worries about what the future
OL,16,Fholds for the Stoke-on-Trent town,
OL,17,Fwhere he believes the high street has
OL,18,Falready lost too much.
